      "writtenOn": "2021-08-30T23:40:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "BTW, the GPIO01 has an external pull-up, i.e. R163. It doesn\u0027t need any internal pull-up.\n\nWhere will the GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW flag be used? The polarity of the INT_L pin is not configurable for PCF85063A. It is ACTIVE_LOW only. The PCF85063A driver just configs the EC interrupt using the flag GPIO_INT_EDGE_FALLING. It seems unnecessary too.",
